Subject: [PATCH 04959/11362] [conductor] In-process docs for PHASE B2 (INFRA;
 RESERVED SLOT 2 of 2) -- extend adversarial_verify.py with an
 ORACLE-DISTINCTNESS + HEADROOM-CONTROL lint for verifier-moat artifacts: a
 moat/beats-SC claim is FLAGGED unless it declares verifier_is_oracle=False,
 headroom_present=True (oracle@K - tuned_sc >= 0.10, flips>0), a TUNED-SC
 baseline (not naive), and a paired CI. Defense-in-depth so a future moat
 over-claim cannot reach a headline.

