@@ -10469,3 +10469,4 @@ Did NOT modify research-roadmap.yaml or scripts/research_conductor.py. Did NOT p
 - 2026-06-30: PHASE D3 (VERIFIER MOAT; the uncertainty-aware construction) -- build EBRM (arXiv:2504.13134, Energy-Based Reward Models, COLM 2025): an energy RM that models the reward DISTRIBUTION with uncertainty (conflict-aware filtering + label-noise-aware contrastive training). Apply it as a post-hoc refinement of a base scorer + an oracle-distinct abstention-on-uncertainty SELECTOR; gate beats-TUNED-SC on a headroom-present corpus. (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete_ebrm_no_win_musr_plus_0p000_ci_incl_0; results/experiment_5005_ebrm_uncertainty_verifier.json
 - 2026-06-30: PHASE D4 (VERIFIER MOAT; CROSS-CORPUS GENERALIZATION) -- evaluate the BEST D1/D2/D3 oracle-distinct verifier on a SECOND headroom-present oracle-distinct corpus (GPQA / MMLU-Pro-hard / MATH-500-hard, whichever is cached + headroom_present). The gate requires MuSR + >=1 second corpus: a single-corpus win could be corpus-specific; a second-corpus confirmation is what makes the moat claim generalize. (⚠️ Research Finding) — honest_verdict=running_moat_second_corpus_mmlu_pro_hard_skeleton; results/experiment_5006_moat_second_corpus.json
 - 2026-06-30: PHASE D5 (VERIFIER MOAT; the falsifiable GATE + DiffusionGemma-gate resolution) -- aggregate D1/D2/D3/D4 and DECIDE the off-ARC verifier-moat verdict: does >=1 oracle-distinct verifier beat TUNED-SC with McNemar CI95 excluding 0 on a headroom-present domain? POSITIVE = the moat is realized off ARC + the DiffusionGemma gate conditions are satisfied on the tested domain. ALL-NULL (LoRA-EBM AND uPRM both fail) = the off-ARC moat retires as bounded (a publishable null converging with the ARC tie). retire_if_same_verdict is decided HERE. (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete_moat_scoped_no_realized_no_bounded_retirement; results/experiment_5007_moat_gate_resolution.json
